### **4. Linter Tier-2 functions (all emit WARNING, no ERROR)**

| Function | Lines | Checks |
|----------|-------|--------|
| `check_residual_rates()` | 139-200 | HIGH residual_count/total > 10% per campaign |
| `check_bypass_trend()` | 203-278 | Increasing sidecar_mode='bypassed' week-over-week (last 4 weeks) |
| `check_popper_adversarial()` | 281-327 | POPPER sidecars ([experiment] + [popper]) missing adversarial_check in outcomes |
| `check_unfired_branches()` | 330-389 | Branches (command+sidecar_sha256) always produce same outcome over 5+ runs |
| `check_adversarial_checks()` | 392-430 | outcomes.pass lacking adversarial_check field |
| `check_threshold_basis()` | 433-499 | Numeric literals in outcome.condition or benchmark.regression_threshold without source/regression_threshold_basis |
| `check_ephemeral_output_paths()` | 502-564 | Runs registering outputs under /tmp, /var/tmp |
| `check_canonical_stage_names()` | 567-662 | Non-canonical stage_name (advisory only; never blocks) |

**Tier-1 (ERROR):** `lint_project()` (lines 84-136) — sidecar presence + file naming conventions in experiments/benchmarks.

